ates the two cases, and it costs one comparison.\"},{\"text\":\"A cap can be raised.\",\"line\":35,\"span\":\"A cap can be raised, and the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0.\"},{\"text\":\"The number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0.\",\"line\":35,\"span\":\"A cap can be raised, and the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0.\"},{\"text\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty.\",\"line\":35,\"span\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty — a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\"},{\"text\":\"A burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\",\"line\":35,\"span\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty — a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\"},{\"text\":\"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap.\",\"line\":35,\"span\":\"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all, which is the outcome everyone prefers.\"},{\"text\":\"Requests for a cap increase reach the platform team through the usual channel.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel, and they are answered within two working days.\"},{\"text\":\"Requests for a cap increase are answered within two working days.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel, and they are answered within two working days.\"},{\"text\":\"There is no expedited path for cap increase requests.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"There is no expedited path and no exception list.\"},{\"text\":\"There is no exception list for cap increase requests.\",\"line\":37,\"span\":\"There is no expedited path and no exception list.\"}]}","ttft_ms":22258,"type":"result","duration_ms":22274,"uuid":"fad26348-1232-4a01-a3f3-6ea9cedd57